    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456500/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.poster.avif?t=1720866900\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456500/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.webm?t=1720866900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456500/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.mp4?t=1720866900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN EXILED PRINCESS..</h2>Follow the adventure of Kalen, a mushroom-like exiled princess, and immerse yourself in a journey through ancient forests filled with secrets and strange inhabitants, forgotten ruins, and, ultimately, greater foes like special bosses and untamed beasts.<br>But she's not alone!<br>Throughout the game, you'll switch between Kalen and Akiro, a mysterious lone warrior whose destiny is intertwined with our heroine's.<br>One fate, two souls, and many worlds to explore!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456500/extras/12252ce6ab6cc4ae1f2fda0bf45682d5.avif?t=1720866900\" /></span><br><br>Meet Kalen, our cozy, mushroom-like heroine!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A NEW SOULSVANIA</h2>Parallel Destiny is a story-based Metroidvania with Souls-like elements, featuring two special playable characters and an intriguing art style that immerses the player completely in its realms.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456500/extras/ea7d384262c81fc836708f4f11b72ff2.avif?t=1720866900\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE DEEPNESS OF THE FOREST</h2>Draw your own maps, learn everything about the lore of each realm, and collect every unique item and skill. Every new secret will unveil a new piece of the mosaic.<br>During your journey, you may also encounter friendly characters like citizens of hidden villages and chummy merchants willing to share their goods with you, all scattered throughout the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456500/extras/e804e0568d717700365956c1bec0ab23.poster.avif?t=1720866900\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456500/extras/e804e0568d717700365956c1bec0ab23.webm?t=1720866900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456500/extras/e804e0568d717700365956c1bec0ab23.mp4?t=1720866900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOM ORCHESTRAL SOUNDTRACK</h2>To inspire you during your odyssey through the realms of Parallel Destiny, you'll hear a dedicated orchestral soundtrack. From the whispering chants of the eerie forest to the dreadfulness of facing a mighty, horrendous boss, and finally, the serenity of reaching the safety of a village or saving spots (bonfires).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE BEAUTY OF PARALLEL DESTINY ARTSTYLE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456500/extras/88ca868e12b7cee72f053241077db861.poster.avif?t=1720866900\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456500/extras/88ca868e12b7cee72f053241077db861.webm?t=1720866900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456500/extras/3c78e05da03f993337533c40d06c2e8b.poster.avif?t=1720866900\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456500/extras/3c78e05da03f993337533c40d06c2e8b.webm?t=1720866900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456500/extras/d07a71722d3929b068c5ed0173ecee8d.poster.avif?t=1720866900\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456500/extras/d07a71722d3929b068c5ed0173ecee8d.webm?t=1720866900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
